"taiHEN plugins: DLC loaders, ports, homebrew" = "taiHEN プラグイン：DLC ローダー、移植版、自作ソフト";
"Keys, screens, controls, graphics, fast forward" = "キー、画面、操作、グラフィック、早送り";
"More memory for heavy games, RAM checker" = "重いゲーム向けのメモリ追加、RAM チェッカー";
"StikDebug, built-in JIT, status" = "StikDebug、内蔵 JIT、状態";
